        />

        <CategoryCard
          category="Home Repairs"
          title="Home Repair Calculators"
          description="Evaluate repair costs, emergency savings, debt pressure, maintenance tradeoffs, and household financial flexibility."
          href="/home-improvement-calculators"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">Financial Planning Guides</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        These guides explain the financial logic behind the calculators,
        including housing affordability, emergency savings, transportation costs,
        vacation budgets, rent pressure, debt management, family costs, and
        long-term financial flexibility.
      </p>

      <div class="popular-row">
        <div class="popular-card">
          <div class="popular-label">Savings</div>
          <h3>How Much Emergency Savings Should I Have?</h3>
          <p>
            Learn how much emergency cushion may make major purchases,
